{"id":124,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"作文と図書館授業で思考力を育てる","feature_description":"久我山中学校の国語科は古典教育と中学3年間の作文教育を重視し、図書館授業を活用した他教科との連携も行うと示しています。思考力・発信力を培うための多角的な授業を展開し、英語科、数学科、社会科、理科、情報科、技術・家庭科、保健体育科、芸術科など各教科で特色ある取り組みを紹介。教科ごとに学びの目的と実践を整理し、授業内容を各教科のページで公開しています。","clubs":[{"id":1950,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1951,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1952,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1953,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1954,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1955,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1956,"name":"弓道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1957,"name":"バレー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1958,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1959,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1960,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1961,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school-life/club/","verified_at":"2026-11-15"},{"id":1962,"name":"写真部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.kugayama-h.ed.jp/school